    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><br>Come hang out with us on Discord!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Take flight and unlock the sky with your own handheld jetpacks! Tourism Infinity invites you to explore Jetpack Island, a tropical paradise and your gateway to exciting jetpack-based <i>Excursions</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/2733a21eccc07b5d85416e195698eacd.poster.avif?t=1647418095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/2733a21eccc07b5d85416e195698eacd.webm?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete for Victory at the Jetpack Stadium Excursion!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/ffd5ac78143a42cd56e3f6813a0ea384.poster.avif?t=1647418095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/ffd5ac78143a42cd56e3f6813a0ea384.webm?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sharpen Your Aim in the Target Practice Excursion!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/c8558d301208df2bf5e9ae71099da2ac.poster.avif?t=1647418095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/c8558d301208df2bf5e9ae71099da2ac.webm?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/c8558d301208df2bf5e9ae71099da2ac.mp4?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More Excursions To Come After Launch:</strong></h2><strong>JETPACK RACING! <i>(Coming Soon)</i></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.poster.avif?t=1647418095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.webm?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.mp4?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Click  To Join Our Community!</h2>",
