g></h2><strong>JETPACK RACING! <i>(Coming Soon)</i></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.poster.avif?t=1647418095\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.webm?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293930/extras/cc56ccb093a0506f0d3e17cce33a1d59.mp4?t=1647418095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Click  To Join Our Community!</h2>",
